 "result": "I worked three apps today and fixed none of them. Each one needs a decision from the developer, and I opened no pull requests.\n\n- **irrigation-station:** The old name returns \"deployment not found\". The same demo is live at irrigation-demo.vercel.app, from the repo sudosilo/irrigation-demo. The link and the spec should point to that name, or the old name should be redeployed.\n- **open-pipeline:** The deployment is gone and no sudosilo repo matches. Its notes say it was a Stumbler fork deployed from a phone with the Vercel CLI. The developer must redeploy it or retire the link.\n- **termbeat:** The live page still has no theme menu, and the repo has not changed since 2026-10-18. The test matches the spec, so the developer must restore the fuller build.\n\nI skipped snapshot-engine-pied, topo-wars-server, tower-builder-five, pajamastan-warrants and mission-operator. Each was attempted within the last 3 days with the same error. I left mary-jane-man for another run because three jobs were the limit.\n\nI logged all three jobs in fix-log.json and added notes. Both are pushed to control-troll main in commit d08e2e2.",
